  "details": "To me, instance description and world description feel like separate things.\n\nI can understand wanting to fill it with something but there is a small distinction there, most of the time the instance creator didn't write the world description and the world creator isn't the one creating the instance.\n\nI think you would expect the instance description to only contain words written by the instance creator, to describe the instance. Filling it with the world description feels potentially unnecessary.",
